# 📦 Packet Analyzer — Complete Project Overview

## What Is This Project?

This is a **Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) Engine** written in **C++17**. It reads network traffic captures (`.pcap` files), inspects every packet down to the application layer, classifies traffic by app (YouTube, Facebook, etc.), applies blocking rules, and writes filtered output.

> Think of it as a mini-ISP firewall/traffic classifier you can run yourself.

---

## Tech Stack

| Aspect | Detail |
|---|---|
| Language | C++17 |
| Build System | CMake 3.16+ (also raw `g++` commands) |
| External Dependencies | **None** — pure stdlib + OS headers |
| Platform | macOS / Linux (Windows setup docs included) |
| Input/Output Format | `.pcap` (Wireshark capture files) |

